@* Monitoring & Dashboard UI: the read side that turns signals from the other
   contexts into visibility and follow-up. The dashboard renders the shared
   library's controls and nothing else yet, so those are the only namespaces
   here — no context namespace belongs in this project.

   Every Backlog.* import is written as @@using global::Backlog.Something. This
   project's root namespace is Backlog.Modules.Monitoring.UI, and the Razor
   generator emits these directives inside that namespace without a global::
   prefix, so a bare "Backlog" would bind to Backlog.Modules the moment anything
   in this project's reference closure declares a Backlog.Modules.Backlog
   namespace. Nothing does today; global:: means nothing has to keep not doing
   it. *@
@using global::Backlog.UI.Components.Buttons
@using global::Backlog.UI.Components.Feedback
@using Backlog.UI.Components.Buttons
@using Backlog.UI.Components.Feedback
